&lt;h2 id="garden-description">Garden Description&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>When this house was excavated in 1826, Fiorelli determined that after the earthquake it had been divided into two separated residences. The southeast corner was the location of a garden (a) that had a portico on three sides with columns connected by a low wall and pilasters on the south wall.&lt;/p>
